WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.290
Hi! I'm Bia. Look at my old photos from last summer!

2
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.595
Last summer, my brother and I were at my grandmother's farm.

3
00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:14.389
It was a beautiful place, and the weather was hot.

4
00:00:16.639 --> 00:00:20.725
Grandma was always in the kitchen. There was an old stove,

5
00:00:21.175 --> 00:00:24.380
and there were always a lot of cakes on the table!

6
00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.602
In the garden, there were many chickens.

7
00:00:30.052 --> 00:00:33.535
There wasn't a dog, but there were two cats.

8
00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:38.339
There wasn't a TV in the living room.

9
00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:43.990
But there was an old record player, and Grandma's music was wonderful.

10
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:51.349
There were other children on the farm too. We were very happy there!

11
00:00:53.599 --> 00:00:56.292
And you? Where were you last summer?

